# ALWAYS: stage tracking (`.cursorrules` §10–11)

These rules apply to **every** task in this repo. Do not skip them.

## GitHub Issues

- Create or update an Issue for each stage/milestone **in the same work cycle**.
- Comment with decisions, blockers, and commit links.
- Do not mark a stage done without an Issue trail.
- Close only after user approval when a gate is required.

Repo (default): `Sintik1/Qa_Asistant`

## `development_report.md`

Update root `development_report.md` on **every** stage with:

1. описание процесса разработки  
2. применённые техники работы с AI  
3. примеры промптов и результатов  
4. описание проблем и их решений  
5. выводы и рекомендации  
6. журнал стадий со ссылками на Issues  

Commit/push the report with the stage deliverable when the stage includes git changes.

## `backend_documentation.md` (backend homework only)

When working on **ДЗ steps 1–9** (DB, Supabase, API): update root `backend_documentation.md` in the same cycle. See `.cursor/rules/backend-homework-dz.mdc`.

## `cicd_integrations_documentation.md` (CI/CD + integrations homework)

When working on **CI/CD / OAuth / analytics / payments / monitoring / security audit** homework steps: update root `cicd_integrations_documentation.md` in the same cycle. See `.cursor/rules/cicd-integrations-dz.mdc`.

## Before the final reply for a stage

- [ ] Issue created/updated  
- [ ] `development_report.md` updated (all required sections for that stage, not only journal)  
- [ ] Backend ДЗ step → `backend_documentation.md` updated (§6 minimum)  
- [ ] CI/CD integrations ДЗ step → `cicd_integrations_documentation.md` updated (§10 minimum)  
- [ ] Code quality rules still applied (architecture, tests, secrets — `.cursorrules` + relevant skills)  
- [ ] User reply includes Issue link + note that report(s) were updated  

Related skill: `qa-assistant-process`. Backend ДЗ: `.cursor/rules/backend-homework-dz.mdc`. CI/CD ДЗ: `.cursor/rules/cicd-integrations-dz.mdc`.
